abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package accompanying the IRMSD conceptual framework
  manuscript. The current release includes prototype source code and
  regression tests, sprint analysis scripts, documentation, and a clearly
  labelled synthetic sprint dataset. The synthetic data are pipeline-check
  materials, not observations from real software development teams.
